	(text "Compatible with STDC14\n\nPin 11 (GNDDetect) can detect\nJTAG cable presence using a 100k\npull-up plus a spare GPIO\n\nThe watchdog shuts off motors when not petted\nJTAG, SWD, BOOT0 do NOT disable the watchdog\nSo, using JTAG/SWD/flash-over-UART stops motors"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 108.458 167.386 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "684d6a7d-c5ed-4b75-b45d-a544822f7292")
	)
	(text "TTL-234X-3V3 cable: 1 GND, 4 TXD -> STM32-RX, 5 RXD <- STM32-TX\n2 CTS#, 3 VCC, 6 RTS# not connected"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 62.484 183.134 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "7e37740c-9b46-4fe7-bea5-515dde47faca")
	)
	(text "PA9 = ~{VMOT-14V4-EN} and UCPD DBCC1. R184 (10k, power sheet) holds it high in reset:\nmotors and LiDAR off, and the dead-battery Rd on CC1 (PB6) on."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 141.986 142.494 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d81821d6-ed32-40c1-ab59-178d428fad6f")
	)
	(text "J1 spare I/O: 0.1in 2x6 header (fitted).\n1 VMCU-3V3 (MCU rail), 2 VSENS-5V-USB, 11/12 GND. No I2C (I2C4 runs at 1 MHz, shared with the ToF, side sensor and IMU).\n3/4 UART PC10 TX / PC11 RX (UART4 or USART3). 5 not connected (PA10 drives the right bumper LED), 6 PE6, 7 not connected (PA8 is the battery sense), 8 PE10 (ADC capable), 9 PD4, 10 PE2.\nIMU AD0/INT2/FSYNC: probe on R217/R92/R211 (IMU sheet). SWO (PB3) on JTAG1 is a spare when not tracing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 148.59 129.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f5b81c75-7d3f-441f-b8ec-2ae2a6b0783d")
	)
